      <div style="margin:30px 0 25px 0;">
        <P id="maintext" style="margin:0; text-align:justify">
        I am an Assistant Professor of Economics at the Sam M. Walton College of Business, University of Arkansas, Fayetteville.
        My <a href="research.html">research interest</a> is in the microeconomics of development.
        I use observational data and experimental methods to study how social context
        interacts with economic incentives to affect behavior.
        </p>
      </div>
